{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23255","headline":"花楼望雪命宴赋诗 · 白居易","name":"花楼望雪命宴赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"连天际海白皑皑，好上高楼望一回。\n何处更能分道路，此时兼不认池台。\n万重云树山头翠，百尺花楼江畔开。\n素壁联题分韵句，红炉巡饮暖寒杯。\n冰铺湖水银爲面，风卷汀沙玉作堆。\n绊惹舞人春艳曳，句留醉客夜裴回。\n输将虚白堂前鹤，失却樟亭驿後梅。\n别有故情偏忆得，曾经穷苦照书来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23255.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23255","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}